() Tj
T*
(Recommended calibration flow:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- move the carriage to the zero point) Tj
T*
(- capture the raw reading as `encoderZeroRaw`) Tj
T*
(- move the carriage a known distance, usually `1000 mm`) Tj
T*
(- capture the raw reading as `encoderFullRaw`) Tj
T*
(- save the actual distance in `encoderReferenceDistanceMm`) Tj
T*
(- set `encoderInvertDirection` if the reading moves opposite to the motion) Tj
T*
() Tj
